[{"x":0.013303768291595724,"w":0.43015522003173828,"text":"6 Rewrite the underlined parts of the sentences using","y":0.042144026222839415,"h":0.013093289689034449},{"w":0.14190687179565431,"text":"participle clauses.","h":0.010229132569558153,"y":0.058101472843819946,"x":0.035476721677930347},{"w":0.37250553131103514,"x":0.062084266894371465,"text":"Our friends understand best how we feel because","h":0.011865793780687417,"y":0.074058919847128202},{"w":0.40354766845703122,"text":"they have experienced many of the same things as us.","x":0.059866969041994268,"y":0.088662790706729777,"h":0.013219369413809745},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.1046511629449669,"text":"Having experienced many of the same things as us,","x":0.059866980520447054,"w":0.38802658081054686},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.11773255829380413,"text":"our friends understand best how we feel.","w":0.30820398330688481,"x":0.059866970070504309},{"text":"1","x":0.035476718464153567,"h":0.0087209301962595243,"y":0.13226744180593997,"w":0.011086474657058719},{"x":0.059727197642495969,"y":0.12950762442623287,"w":0.36180625915527342,"h":0.015896052658655457,"text":"Because I had never had a female friend before,"},{"x":0.057649664412299802,"w":0.40798225402832033,"y":0.14680232563284412,"text":"I didn't know what to expect when our friendship began.","h":0.013181307507029505},{"text":"I didn't know what to expect when our friendship began.","y":0.17587209317752506,"w":0.40354766845703127,"x":0.059866970723442776,"h":0.011627906668205679},{"h":0.010319529110398129,"w":0.39911308288574221,"y":0.19026186590261873,"text":"2 Close friends often seem to know what is on each","x":0.035476722969545592},{"text":"other's minds because they spend so much of their","x":0.059866969790209695,"y":0.20494186069205989,"w":0.38580928802490233,"h":0.01162790666820579},{"x":0.059794744679670338,"y":0.21918720071558728,"h":0.012206993789797727,"text":"time together.","w":0.10657459259033203},{"w":0.011086474657058712,"h":0.010174418042022015,"x":0.035476718214707895,"y":0.2761627908094153,"text":"3"},{"w":0.37028823852539067,"y":0.24709302335194372,"x":0.059866970914688199,"text":"close friends often seem to know what is on each","h":0.011627906668205679},{"h":0.0087209301962594132,"y":0.2630813953669866,"x":0.059866966051715986,"w":0.10421285629272461,"text":"other's minds."},{"h":0.016775344280486548,"x":0.059692141454443327,"w":0.39281082153320312,"text":"Friends can share secrets because they have gained","y":0.27358907165040125},{"w":0.13303769111633301,"h":0.010229132569558153,"text":"each other's trust.","y":0.29214402621389979,"x":0.059866962091500928},{"y":0.31950673081581193,"text":"friends can share secrets.","w":0.18920204162597656,"x":0.059476942376500898,"h":0.013378396166912276},{"h":0.013095668802089566,"text":"4 Because they are often interested in the same things,","w":0.42572059631347653,"x":0.035476737246070013,"y":0.33428805231894221},{"x":0.059866974948866523,"h":0.013274083941345771,"text":"friends always have something to talk about.","y":0.34883720930532469,"w":0.33481151580810553},{"w":0.33481151580810548,"y":0.37643207850505878,"x":0.059866963862392382,"text":"friends always have something to talk about.","h":0.013102804970624216},{"x":0.011086480585068585,"y":0.39811783953998714,"w":0.44345897674560547,"h":0.011865793780687417,"text":"7 Read the task and the article below. Then choose the"},{"w":0.11973392486572265,"x":0.035476720272238395,"text":"correct option.","y":0.41407528644593516,"h":0.010343317899688342},{"h":0.021290068930768014,"w":0.28689231872558596,"text":"This week's competition","y":0.44233658127661335,"x":0.023977584812257539},{"y":0.46931260236699934,"x":0.0243902521326444,"h":0.011865793780687306,"w":0.43237247467041018,"text":"Technology and teenagers go hand in hand nowadays."},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.48401162800310638,"text":"However, this isn't necessarily a good thing. Do you","w":0.40798225402832033,"x":0.026607546688722224},{"y":0.49836333877068284,"w":0.35476718902587889,"h":0.011865793780687417,"text":"think technology is overused or used well by","x":0.024390245841827644},{"y":0.51308139543043207,"h":0.011627906668205679,"text":"adolescents? If you are a teenager, we want to hear","x":0.024390254978465718,"w":0.4124168395996094},{"text":"your views. Send us an article in which you describe","h":0.011865793780687417,"w":0.41019954681396481,"y":0.52741407522281591,"x":0.024390253893460886},{"y":0.54214402603234879,"w":0.3835919952392578,"h":0.011635043617161056,"text":"the very best things about using technology and","x":0.024390250357089586},{"x":0.026607543712269095,"h":0.011644558898750934,"w":0.24390243530273437,"y":0.55668604662956001,"text":"discuss the challenges it poses."},{"text":"A selection of the best articles will be printed in the","y":0.56784261051595897,"w":0.40836273193359379,"h":0.015911899104641303,"x":0.026427396330687428},{"h":0.013095668802089677,"text":"upcoming edition of Psychology Magazine.","x":0.026607554728271126,"w":0.34146339416503907,"y":0.58428805212514368},{"x":0.03302423688238456,"w":0.33528190612792969,"text":"Technology:","y":0.6402028843346721,"h":0.045175627288568609},{"x":0.035476718446671496,"h":0.018912000859037326,"y":0.68166939434435458,"w":0.29933481216430663,"text":"controlled or in control?"},{"w":0.43237251281738276,"y":0.84738134189877212,"x":0.035476720171131043,"text":"Have you ever wondered why teens are so keen on technology?","h":0.011630285781261018},{"w":0.43237247467041018,"x":0.03547674104616938,"h":0.013255052597745176,"text":"'Growing up \/ Having grown up with it, we are digital natives","y":0.85883797060662004},{"h":0.010174418042022237,"text":"- people who are at ease with everything from the Internet to","x":0.035476725613419371,"y":0.87500000035398895,"w":0.43015518188476565},{"x":0.035476719090199858,"text":"smartphones, apps and computer games. However, I can report that","y":0.88788870715915114,"w":0.43237251281738281,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"text":"while technology plays a huge role in my life, I do not overuse it.","h":0.011865793780687306,"y":0.90098199664808187,"x":0.035476725613419371,"w":0.43015518188476565},{"x":0.50776053887665396,"h":0.010310013828808251,"text":"SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT","y":0.050736497687357884,"w":0.26829267501831056},{"y":0.075511846762355117,"h":0.013867632652070472,"w":0.34610225677490236,"x":0.49435885775668764,"text":"8 Complete the writing task in Exercise 2."},{"x":0.51884700699503494,"text":"Before you start, follow steps 1-3 below.","y":0.090016366475837106,"w":0.32815963745117194,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"text":"1 Think about where your article will appear","x":0.51884702440974517,"y":0.10883797068521561,"h":0.011865793780687417,"w":0.34811527252197272},{"x":0.54545454879430189,"y":0.12354651160971908,"h":0.0087209301962595243,"w":0.15299334526062014,"text":"and who will read it."},{"text":"2 Make notes on the role of friendship.","h":0.01549893861511531,"x":0.51864366569133713,"y":0.13438750919543085,"w":0.31087598800659177},{"h":0.015663641759494751,"y":0.14984826991612998,"w":0.21582239151000981,"text":"Think of at least two points.","x":0.54504862171993107},{"text":"3 Decide which techniques you are going to use to","w":0.39911308288574221,"x":0.51884701022010005,"y":0.16715116285775755,"h":0.011654074570551343},{"y":0.18003273308810264,"text":"attract and hold the reader's attention.","x":0.54545455516077279,"h":0.011865793780687417,"w":0.29268291473388675},{"y":0.22093023265426925,"text":"SHOW THAT YOU'VE CHECKED","x":0.50776053464852677,"h":0.011627906668205679,"w":0.27937915802001956},{"text":"In my article:","y":0.24549918180551433,"h":0.011865793780687417,"w":0.11751662254333495,"x":0.49889135417548702},{"x":0.50531699698406174,"y":0.26530822203725657,"h":0.017171978365184803,"w":0.36640213012695311,"text":"• I have used one of the techniques to come up"},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"x":0.51884701023912105,"text":"with an interesting title.","y":0.28343023290620728,"w":0.18403547286987298},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.30232558150116851,"w":0.39246116638183592,"x":0.50554325927027921,"text":"• in the first paragraph, I have presented the topic"},{"w":0.27716184616088868,"h":0.010340939176843422,"y":0.31669394423854746,"x":0.52106431435488443,"text":"and attracted the reader's attention."},{"text":"•in the main part, have developed the topic.","x":0.50554324395086991,"w":0.36141906738281249,"y":0.33866279080349404,"h":0.011627906668205679},{"w":0.019955654144287127,"h":0.014534883140151944,"text":"C","x":0.91352549878705813,"y":0.33575581406219146},{"x":0.5055432502206918,"text":"• in the last paragraph, I have given my personal","y":0.35883797041282162,"h":0.013255052597745176,"w":0.37472282409667967},{"w":0.4124168395996094,"x":0.52106430059930853,"y":0.37193126049545122,"h":0.013243158203099958,"text":"opinion and given the reader something to think ("},{"h":0.0087209301962595243,"w":0.050997781753540083,"text":"about.","x":0.52106430139041404,"y":0.38953488381175394},{"h":0.01162790666820579,"y":0.40988372113295135,"text":"• I have used formal or neutral language.","w":0.31707315444946282,"x":0.50554324010712381},{"text":"C","y":0.40697674448262688,"x":0.91352549884626721,"w":0.022172949314117507,"h":0.015988371766335385},{"h":0.014534883140151944,"text":"C","x":0.91352549864671062,"w":0.022172949314117396,"y":0.43168604665666821},{"x":0.50554322986290079,"w":0.35698448181152342,"text":"•Ihave checked my spelling and punctuation.","y":0.43453355143685757,"h":0.011865793780687306},{"h":0.016516034614825204,"w":0.3463417053222656,"text":"• I have used at least one participle clause to","y":0.45273556664638126,"x":0.50533572285160422},{"x":0.52328159782212769,"text":"express reason.","y":0.47238372091204461,"h":0.0087946752869750844,"w":0.11973392486572265},{"text":"• my handwriting is neat enough for someone","w":0.35476718902587889,"h":0.013264568269545474,"x":0.50554323741610707,"y":0.48837209283245642},{"w":0.099778270721435525,"y":0.50436046547026803,"h":0.010369485411823476,"text":"else to read.","x":0.52106429978340651},{"x":0.91352549848973352,"h":0.015988371766335385,"text":"O","w":0.024390244483947776,"y":0.45930232563053663},{"y":0.63979333750498468,"x":0.49433214114809088,"w":0.43483184814453124,"text":"Using technology has many benefits. For many of us, the Internet","h":0.01496890016546415},{"x":0.49445676271547712,"h":0.010229132569558042,"y":0.65548281499064576,"text":"is a valuable tool which allows us to research information and","w":0.43237251281738276},{"text":"educate ourselves easily through access to different cultures and","h":0.011656453293396041,"y":0.66857610459497041,"w":0.43458976745605471,"x":0.49445678648631086},{"y":0.68166939424155337,"w":0.43237247467041012,"x":0.49445677400995408,"h":0.011644558898751045,"text":"perspectives. In addition, keeping in touch with friends using"},{"x":0.49223946658541279,"h":0.011635043226950748,"text":"smartphones and social media gives us a sense of community","w":0.43680709838867188,"y":0.69622093058062584},{"y":0.70930232566299012,"text":"and helps us maintain supportive relationships and develop our","w":0.43680709838867188,"h":0.011646938011806163,"x":0.49223947178681698},{"w":0.43680709838867188,"y":0.72238372101182735,"h":0.01165883201624085,"text":"identities. Finally, online games allow us to share interests with","x":0.49223947178681698},{"text":"people we would never normally meet.","x":0.49445676788735393,"w":0.26385808944702149,"h":0.011639801062850785,"y":0.7369067103381125},{"text":"As we all know, the benefits of technology are not without risk.","y":0.76308139558654708,"w":0.43237251281738276,"x":0.4944567634360979,"h":0.01024102657399284},{"text":"A recent survey showed some shocking statistics. 2Spending \/","y":0.77454991808215268,"x":0.49445676379124309,"w":0.43458980560302735,"h":0.013240779480255149},{"text":"Having spent up to nine hours a day on social media, some teens","x":0.49445676560203394,"y":0.78924418612810643,"w":0.43458980560302735,"h":0.01162790666820579},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.80232558151328093,"w":0.43458980560302735,"x":0.49445676560203394,"text":"are becoming isolated from the real world; 3checking \/ having"},{"x":0.49445676451555942,"text":"checked their phones more than ten times a night, 10 percent","y":0.81669394419009778,"h":0.010340939176843533,"w":0.43458980560302729},{"w":0.43237251281738276,"x":0.4944567634360979,"y":0.82978723421128031,"text":"of young people have serious sleep problems. Furthermore,","h":0.011865793780687306},{"text":"learning how to be a good digital citizen and being able to","y":0.84288052362269161,"h":0.011865793780687306,"x":0.49223945904661037,"w":0.43680709838867182},{"w":0.41241683959960934,"x":0.49445677382547232,"text":"analyse content for its accuracy and value can be a struggle.","h":0.011865793780687417,"y":0.85597381336617395},{"w":0.43237251281738276,"text":"Despite the challenges, as far as l am concerned, once you learn","x":0.4944567634360979,"y":0.88216039279499914,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"h":0.011865793780687417,"text":"to establish sensible boundaries and use technology safely, the","x":0.49445678456465542,"y":0.89525368240282255,"w":0.43458976745605465},{"w":0.43458976745605471,"y":0.9083469721436912,"text":"benefits are endless. I believe that most teens are aware of this","x":0.49445677222171414,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"x":0.49445678383996094,"text":"and that they are in control of technology, not controlled by it.","y":0.92296511623954047,"h":0.01162790666820579,"w":0.43237247467041018},{"text":"31","x":0.91796008829017695,"y":0.9651162791711827,"h":0.011627906668205679,"w":0.024390244483947776}]